{"id":"e4893a161f1a3b40","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-sumcheck-protocol.md","title":"有逐变量次数界的Sumcheck协议","display":"df-sumcheck-protocol — 有逐变量次数界的Sumcheck协议","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-sumcheck-protocol","aliases":["28-df-sumcheck-protocol"],"display":"df-sumcheck-protocol — 有逐变量次数界的Sumcheck协议","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; §8.3.2 Sumcheck protocol","source_printed_pages":"159–160","source_pdf_pages":"185–186","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-sumcheck-protocol"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-sumcheck-protocol</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sumcheck-protocol — 有逐变量次数界的Sumcheck协议"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; §8.3.2 Sumcheck protocol"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"159–160"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"185–186"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 为有限域，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q=|F|\">\\(q=|F|\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(d\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\in F[X_1,\\ldots,X_n]\">\\(g\\in F[X_1,\\ldots,X_n]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\deg_{X_i}g\\le d\">\\(\\deg_{X_i}g\\le d\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\in F\">\\(K\\in F\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U_d=\\{h\\in F[Z]:\\deg h\\le d\\}\">\\(\\mathcal U_d=\\{h\\in F[Z]:\\deg h\\le d\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\deg0=-\\infty\">\\(\\deg0=-\\infty\\)</span>。证明者策略 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_i:F^{i-1}\\to\\mathcal U_d\">\\(P_i:F^{i-1}\\to\\mathcal U_d\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i=1,\\ldots,n\">\\(i=1,\\ldots,n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec P=(P_1,\\ldots,P_n)\">\\(\\vec P=(P_1,\\ldots,P_n)\\)</span>；随机向量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r=(r_1,\\ldots,r_n)\">\\(r=(r_1,\\ldots,r_n)\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F^n\">\\(F^n\\)</span> 均匀分布。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 可精确计算g在任意F^n点的值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s_i(r)\\coloneqq P_i(r_1,\\ldots,r_{i-1}),\\qquad k_0(r)\\coloneqq K,\\qquad k_i(r)\\coloneqq s_i(r)(r_i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s_i(r)\\coloneqq P_i(r_1,\\ldots,r_{i-1}),\\qquad k_0(r)\\coloneqq K,\\qquad k_i(r)\\coloneqq s_i(r)(r_i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SCAcc}(g,K,\\vec P,r)\\Longleftrightarrow\\left[\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;s_i(r)(0_F)+s_i(r)(1_F)=k_{i-1}(r)\\right]\\land k_n(r)=g(r_1,\\ldots,r_n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SCAcc}(g,K,\\vec P,r)\\Longleftrightarrow\\left[\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;s_i(r)(0_F)+s_i(r)(1_F)=k_{i-1}(r)\\right]\\land k_n(r)=g(r_1,\\ldots,r_n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SCPr}(g,K,\\vec P)\\coloneqq q^{-n}\\left|\\{r\\in F^n:\\operatorname{SCAcc}(g,K,\\vec P,r)\\}\\right|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SCPr}(g,K,\\vec P)\\coloneqq q^{-n}\\left|\\{r\\in F^n:\\operatorname{SCAcc}(g,K,\\vec P,r)\\}\\right|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每轮先接收次数至多d的单变量多项式（以至多d+1个系数编码），检查0与1处之和，再公布独立均匀域元素；最终直接评估g。任何超过次数界或无效编码的消息均立即拒绝，因此任意可能通过的确定型作弊策略已由P_i的值域覆盖。协议用n轮并在最后随机点直接求值；与书中n=1直接求两个端点的基例版略有轮数差异，但对应相同Sumcheck机制。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 Arora–Barak PDF，§8.3.2 Sumcheck protocol；印刷 pp.159–160 / PDF pp.185–186。本次核对范围：定义陈述与本地形式化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"q=|F|","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"d\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"g\\in F[X_1,\\ldots,X_n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\deg_{X_i}g\\le d","display":false},{"tex":"K\\in F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U_d=\\{h\\in F[Z]:\\deg h\\le d\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\deg0=-\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"P_i:F^{i-1}\\to\\mathcal U_d","display":false},{"tex":"i=1,\\ldots,n","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec P=(P_1,\\ldots,P_n)","display":false},{"tex":"r=(r_1,\\ldots,r_n)","display":false},{"tex":"F^n","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"s_i(r)\\coloneqq P_i(r_1,\\ldots,r_{i-1}),\\qquad k_0(r)\\coloneqq K,\\qquad k_i(r)\\coloneqq s_i(r)(r_i).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SCAcc}(g,K,\\vec P,r)\\Longleftrightarrow\\left[\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;s_i(r)(0_F)+s_i(r)(1_F)=k_{i-1}(r)\\right]\\land k_n(r)=g(r_1,\\ldots,r_n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SCPr}(g,K,\\vec P)\\coloneqq q^{-n}\\left|\\{r\\in F^n:\\operatorname{SCAcc}(g,K,\\vec P,r)\\}\\right|.","display":true}],"bytes":2089,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-310","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-deterministic-interactive-proof]]、[[28-thm-dip-equals-np]]、[[28-df-formula-arithmetization]]、[[28-df-sumcheck-protocol]]、[[28-thm-sumcheck-soundness]]、[[28-df-program-checker]]。"},{"id":"295bcb75516a492e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用 [[28-df-sumcheck-protocol]] 的 $F,q,n,d,g,K,\\mathcal U_d,\\operatorname{SCPr}$，并有 $d<q$；策略组属于 $\\prod_{i=1}^n\\mathcal U_d^{F^{i-1}}$。"}],"outgoing":[]}